    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d770">

                <pb facs="0838" n="740" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg740"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.119/271: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jay</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-02-16T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 16,
                                1920—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>25. Department’s May 20, 6 p.m., 1919,<anchor n="88" xml:id="d770-f1"/> and
                    November 28, 2 p.m., 1919.<anchor n="89" xml:id="d770-f2"/></p>
                <p>It is desired that you report by telegraph what if any representations were made
                    by you to the Italian Government and the results thereof.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
